        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cinco Paul, Ken Daurio, Blair Hayes, Jake Gyllenhaal\n- Films: Bubble Boy, Dr. Seuss' Horton Hears a Who, Despicable Me, Dr. Seuss' The Lorax, Despicable Me 2, The Secret Life of Pets, Despicable Me 3\n- Companies: Illumination Entertainment, Universal Pictures\n- Roles: screenwriters, director, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Cinco Paul and Ken Daurio are American screenwriters.\n- Bubble Boy is a 2001 American comedy film directed by Blair Hayes, starring Jake Gyllenhaal in the title role, and written by Cinco Paul and Ken Daurio.\n- Cinco Paul and Ken Daurio are primarily known for writing screenplays for animated films including Dr. Seuss' Horton Hears a Who, Despicable Me, Dr. Seuss' The Lorax, Despicable Me 2, The Secret Life of Pets, and Despicable Me 3.\n- Despicable Me 3, stylized in marketing and onscreen as Despicable M3, is a 2017 American 3D computer-animated comedy film produced by Illumination Entertainment for Universal Pictures.",
